<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM FIRST ROUND OF GREATER HARTFORD OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM FIRST ROUND OF GREATER HARTFORD OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>CROMWELL, Connecticut 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores</p>
<p>from the first round of the $1.5 million Greater Hartford Open</p>
<p>Thursday at the par-70 TPC at River Highlands (U.S. unless</p>
<p>noted):</p>
<p>64  Wayne Levi, Eric Johnson</p>
<p>65  Steve Pate</p>
<p>66  J.P. Hayes, Tom Byrum, Joe Durant, Doug Barron</p>
<p>67  Kevin Sutherland, Jeff Maggert, John Morse, Charlie Rymer,</p>
<p>    Lennie Clements, P.H. Horgan III, Anthony Rodriguez, Tom</p>
<p>    Pernice Jr., Brent Geiberger, Paul Stankowski, Brad Faxon,</p>
<p>    Kelly Gibson</p>
<p>68  Brian Claar, Doug Martin, David Ogrin, Kenny Perry, Larry</p>
<p>    Mize, Craig Kanada, Billy Andrade, Nolan Henke, Brandel</p>
<p>    Chamblee, Bob Wolcott, Sonny Skinner</p>
<p>Other international players:</p>
<p>69  Phil Tataurangi (New Zealand), Bradley Hughes (Australia)</p>
<p>71  Eduardo Herrera (Colombia)</p>
<p>73  Grant Waite (New Zealand), Gabriel Hjertstedt (Sweden)</p>
<p>74  Yoshinori Kaneko (Japan), Rafael Alarcon (Mexico)</p>
</text>
